'''Jal-ImKot''' is one of the [[volcanic creatures]] found in the [[Inferno]].

Jal-ImKots only use [[melee]], but make up for it with extremely damaging attacks. If a Jal-ImKot cannot reach the player, it will burrow into the ground and reappear next to the player to attack them. There is a six [[RuneScape clock|game tick]] delay before the Jal-ImKot attacks after resurfacing, so players can use this time to change [[prayers]] or move out of the way.

Jal-ImKots dig 50 ticks after the start of a wave, and every 40-60 ticks thereafter. This timer is reset whenever the Jal-ImKot enters combat with the player. However, the timer cannot be reset within the first 30 ticks of the wave starting.

